Z||000018||artherd||08-08-2001||07:21 AM||||Hi Grinthock, I've had the pleasure (so to speak) in a Mondial 3.2 Cabriolet, 308QV, and in a 355 Spyder...<P>Wow. <P>I am still recovering from the last.<P>I always love reading magazine reviews for the 355 and 360, as universally the typical restraint is forgotten, and you basically get a page full of "YES YES!!! This car made me cry!!!!  OH MY GOD You have to have one!!!"    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Next on my list is a Testarosa, preferably a 94 512TR.<P>Between the 355 Spyder and the 512TR, well, It'd be impossible to pick a favourite. Gotta get both! (hrm, and maybe a 355F1 Spyder too) <P>PS: 30th Aniv SE Diablo, and Countach have special places in my heart.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
