Z||000020||TRiAD||08-08-2001||11:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JSocha:<BR><B>Loosely translated in Italian, Countach, I believe meant or means "Oh my God".  Apparently some guy visiting the Lamborghini factory said that when the first one rolled off the assembly line and it stuck...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It was Nuccio Bertone, when he saw the CHASSIS. He was employed to have Marcello Gandini design the body. <P>Beautiful cars...<P><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
